[00:12.187]Go!
{"冲！"}
[00:12.658]
[00:23.089]Try as all might to succeed
{"竭尽全力只为成功"}
[00:25.738]You make it so hard to believe
{"你让信念如此难守"}
[00:28.395]And I'm chasing dreams that can achieve
{"追逐着触手可及的梦"}
[00:33.745]And each time doubt to fail
{"每次怀疑将失败"}
[00:36.661]I dare myself to bail on now
{"我逼自己此刻放弃"}
[00:39.312]I'm tangled in the sence of security
{"困在安全感的牢笼里"}
[00:43.591]
[00:44.643]I've learnt to take the rejection
{"我已学会承受拒绝"}
[00:47.042]to struggle with every mistake
{"与每个错误抗争"}
[00:49.687]It's the step in the right direction
{"这是迈向正确的方向"}
[00:52.087]They say
{"他们说"}
[00:53.420]
[00:54.759]You gotta fight for the right to be here!
{"你必须为生存权而战！"}
[00:59.836]You gotta fight for the right to stand tall!
{"你必须为挺立权而战！"}
[01:05.192]You better fight for the right to get noticed!
{"你最好为被看见而战！"}
[01:09.469]
[01:10.517]It's a big world that we're living
{"我们身处广袤世界"}
[01:12.394]Too easy to give in
{"投降太过轻易"}
[01:13.724]So fight for your right to be,
{"为你的存在权而战，"}
[01:15.327]For the right to be here
{"为生存的权利"}
